    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get back here with my sandwich!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The nefarious Jerkwad pilfered your lunch while you were grabbing napkins and it's up to you to get it back! Bump, jump, dash and crash through him and his minions in this top-down car combat smash-a-thon!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Road Ahead</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here's what to expect as you embark on your quest to reclaim ownership of your perfect sandwich</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five worlds, each with unique conditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 perilous levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No less than five Boss Fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least 25 unique enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgradable abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable cars with game-changing powers</p></li></ul>",
